    [Doc][Misc] Update DeepSeek V4 Pro A3 DSpark PD deployment for MRv2 (#19184)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    This PR updates the DeepSeek-V4-Pro deployment tutorial for the Atlas
    800 A3 series with DSpark. Specifically, it:
    - Removes the legacy "A3 series" deployment section to focus on the
    recommended DSpark-based deployment.
    - Updates the disaggregated Prefill-Decode (PD) deployment guide for the
    A3 series, introducing the `--pcp-size` (Prefill Context Parallel size)
    parameter to `launch_online_dp.py` and the template script.
    - Updates default ports in `launch_online_dp.py` (`--dp-rpc-port` to
    `"12321"` and `--vllm-start-port` to `7100`).
    - Updates the prefill and decode scripts to use `MooncakeConnectorV2`
    instead of `MooncakeHybridConnector` and aligns configurations with
    Model Runner V2 (MRv2).
    - Updates the detailed node configuration tables to reflect the new
    DP/TP/PP/PCP topology.
    
    These changes are needed to align the documentation with the latest
    vLLM-Ascend features and provide an up-to-date, working example for
    DeepSeek-V4-Pro deployment.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    No, this is a documentation-only update.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    Documentation-only update.
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/a98247ab4db686ee03c66d5feb3c761e52a2f8ab
    
